    <div class="doc" data-l="en" lang="en"><header class="head"><p class="head__meta"><span>Effective 3 November 2026</span><span>Operated by True JPEG</span></p><h1>Terms &amp; Policies</h1></header><div class="cols"><nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents"><p>Contents</p><ol><li><a href="#terms"><span>01</span>Terms of Use</a></li><li><a href="#content"><span>02</span>Content &amp; Age</a></li><li><a href="#disclaimer"><span>03</span>Disclaimer</a></li><li><a href="#privacy"><span>04</span>Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="#copyright"><span>05</span>Copyright &amp; Removal</a></li><li><a href="#affiliate"><span>06</span>Affiliate Links</a></li><li><a href="#contact"><span>07</span>Changes, Law &amp; Contact</a></li></ol></nav><div class="secs"><section class="sec" id="terms-en" data-sec="terms" aria-labelledby="terms-en-h"><div class="sec__no">01</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="terms-en-h">Terms of Use</h2><p>True JPEG (truejpeg.com, “the site”) shows AI-generated images together with the prompts used to make them. By using the site you agree to these terms. If you don’t agree, please don’t use it.</p><ul><li>You can copy the prompts for free and use them for your own image generation, personal or commercial.</li><li>You may not resell the site’s images, design or curated collection, republish them as a set, or present them as your own work.</li><li>Don’t scrape the site in bulk with automated tools, and don’t interfere with how it runs.</li><li>Don’t use the prompts to make anything illegal, anything that infringes someone else’s rights, or any sexual content involving minors.</li><li>We may change, pause or remove any content or feature at any time without notice.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="content-en" data-sec="content" aria-labelledby="content-en-h"><div class="sec__no">02</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="content-en-h">Content &amp; Age</h2><ul><li>Every image on the site is generated by AI. The people in them are fictional adults, not real people. Any resemblance is coincidental.</li><li>Some images are sexually suggestive. They appear only in the NSFW category and never under All. Before that category opens, you’ll be asked to confirm you are 18 or older.</li><li>If you are under 18, or such content isn’t allowed where you live, don’t open the NSFW category.</li><li>We don’t publish sexual content involving minors. If you see an image that looks wrong, contact us and we’ll deal with it quickly.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="disclaimer-en" data-sec="disclaimer" aria-labelledby="disclaimer-en-h"><div class="sec__no">03</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="disclaimer-en-h">Disclaimer</h2><ul><li>Everything here is provided as is, for reference and inspiration. The same prompt won’t always give the same image: results depend on the model, its version, the settings and chance.</li><li>All images are made with closed-source models from third-party companies; the model is named on each work. We don’t train or run these models. Content review and safety filtering at generation time are handled by each model’s company under its own policies, and questions about a model’s output, training data or related rights fall under that company’s terms. What we do is choose which images are published here, and we remove any that turn out to be a problem.</li><li>Model and tool details are correct as of publication. Third-party services may change afterwards.</li><li>Third-party sites and services we link to (such as X, Yir and Higgsfield) are run by their own operators. Check their terms and prices before using them. Payments, accounts and data on those services are not our responsibility.</li><li>To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss that comes from using the site or from being unable to use it.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="privacy-en" data-sec="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-en-h"><div class="sec__no">04</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="privacy-en-h">Privacy Policy</h2><p>There is no sign-up, no account and no ad tracking. This is everything we record or handle:</p><ul><li>Anonymous usage counts: which page or work was opened, which prompt was copied, which share link brought you here (the ?s= tag in the link), your country or region (estimated by Cloudflare from the network) and whether you’re on a phone. No IP addresses, no cookies, and no ID that could tell us who you are.</li><li>Cloudflare Web Analytics: anonymous visit statistics from Cloudflare, without cookies.</li><li>Your browser’s local storage: your language, layout choice and age confirmation. They stay in your browser and are never sent to us. Clearing your browser data removes them.</li><li>The site is hosted on Cloudflare and its fonts come from Google Fonts. When a page loads, these services handle your network request (including your IP address) under their own privacy policies.</li><li>If you email us, we receive your address and your message and use them only to reply.</li><li>We don’t sell any data.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="copyright-en" data-sec="copyright" aria-labelledby="copyright-en-h"><div class="sec__no">05</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="copyright-en-h">Copyright &amp; Removal</h2><ul><li>If you think an image or prompt on the site infringes your rights (your likeness, your work, a trademark), or you’d like something taken down, email us with the work number or link and the reason. Once we’ve checked, we’ll remove or change it promptly.</li><li>When we prepare prompts for the site, we remove the names of real people.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="affiliate-en" data-sec="affiliate" aria-labelledby="affiliate-en-h"><div class="sec__no">06</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="affiliate-en-h">Affiliate Links</h2><ul><li>Some links on the site are affiliate links (links to Yir and Higgsfield, for example). If you sign up or pay through one, the site may earn a commission.</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="contact-en" data-sec="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-en-h"><div class="sec__no">07</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="contact-en-h">Changes, Law &amp; Contact</h2><ul><li>We may update this page. Changes are posted here with a new effective date. If you keep using the site after an update, you accept the new version.</li><li>These terms are governed by the laws of Japan. The Tokyo District Court has exclusive jurisdiction in the first instance over any dispute about the site.</li><li>This page comes in English, Japanese and Chinese. If they differ, the Japanese version prevails.</li><li>Contact: <a href="mailto:tjtjpeg@gmail.com">tjtjpeg@gmail.com</a></li></ul></div></section></div></div></div>
    <div class="doc" data-l="ja" lang="ja"><header class="head"><p class="head__meta"><span>施行日 2026年11月3日</span><span>運営者 True JPEG</span></p><h1>規約とポリシー</h1></header><div class="cols"><nav class="toc" aria-label="目次"><p>目次</p><ol><li><a href="#terms"><span>01</span>利用規約</a></li><li><a href="#content"><span>02</span>コンテンツと年齢</a></li><li><a href="#disclaimer"><span>03</span>免責事項</a></li><li><a href="#privacy"><span>04</span>プライバシーポリシー</a></li><li><a href="#copyright"><span>05</span>著作権と削除依頼</a></li><li><a href="#affiliate"><span>06</span>アフィリエイトリンク（広告）</a></li><li><a href="#contact"><span>07</span>変更・準拠法・お問い合わせ</a></li></ol></nav><div class="secs"><section class="sec" id="terms-ja" data-sec="terms" aria-labelledby="terms-ja-h"><div class="sec__no">01</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="terms-ja-h">利用規約</h2><p>True JPEG（truejpeg.com、以下「本サイト」）は、AIで生成した画像と、その生成に使ったプロンプトを掲載しています。本サイトを利用した時点で、本規約に同意したものとみなします。同意いただけない場合は、ご利用をお控えください。</p><ul><li>プロンプトは無料でコピーでき、ご自身の画像生成に使えます。個人利用・商用利用を問いません。</li><li>本サイトの画像、デザイン、作品集としてのまとまりを、転売したり、まとめて再配布したり、ご自身の作品として発表したりしないでください。</li><li>自動ツールによる大量取得（スクレイピング）や、本サイトの運営を妨げる行為はおやめください。</li><li>プロンプトを使って、違法なもの、他人の権利を侵害するもの、未成年者を含む性的なものを作らないでください。</li><li>本サイトは、予告なく内容や機能を変更・停止・削除することがあります。</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="content-ja" data-sec="content" aria-labelledby="content-ja-h"><div class="sec__no">02</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="content-ja-h">コンテンツと年齢</h2><ul><li>本サイトの画像はすべてAIで生成しています。写っている人物はすべて架空の成人で、実在の人物ではありません。似ている場合も偶然です。</li><li>一部に性的な表現を含む画像があります。これらはNSFWカテゴリーにだけ表示され、「すべて」には出ません。NSFWカテゴリーを開く前に、18歳以上であることを確認します。</li><li>18歳未満の方、またはお住まいの地域の法令で閲覧が認められていない方は、NSFWカテゴリーを開かないでください。</li><li>未成年者を含む性的なコンテンツは掲載しません。問題のある画像を見つけた場合はご連絡ください。速やかに対応します。</li></ul></div></section><section class="sec" id="disclaimer-ja" data-sec="disclaimer" aria-labelledby="disclaimer-ja-h"><div class="sec__no">03</div><div class="sec__body"><h2 id="disclaimer-ja-h">免責事項</h2><ul><li>本サイトのコンテンツは現状のまま、参考やインスピレーションのために提供しています。同じプロンプトで同じ画像ができ